Line
# High-symmetry k-path for Si (FCC Brillouin zone)
# Format: label  kx  ky  kz  npoints
# The last segment uses 1 point (just the endpoint label)
G   0.000  0.000  0.000  30   # Gamma
X   0.500  0.000  0.500  30   # X
W   0.500  0.250  0.750  30   # W
L   0.500  0.500  0.500  30   # L
G   0.000  0.000  0.000  30   # Gamma
K   0.375  0.375  0.750  1    # K (endpoint)
#
# Adjust npoints (e.g. 50) for smoother band plots.
# Use SeekPath or SeeK-path to generate k-paths for other structures.
